to ease a safety valve and use a blow down cock or valve;
(vi)
to adjust a high steam and low water safety valve and renew a fusible plug;
(vii)
to joint a manhole or handhole door or any cover or flange in the steam or feed pipes;
(viii)
to pack pump or valve chest glands;
(ix)
to grind and adjust cocks and valves;
(x)
to take a donkey pump or injector to pieces and replace in working order.
